          "title": "What is this?"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**Bootstrap Daemon** ports `bootstrapd` from [roothide Bootstrap](https://github.com/roothide/Bootstrap) to run natively on **palera1n**.\n\nEnables:\n- **JIT** for apps like DolphiniOS, UTM, PPSSPP\n- **SSH** server management\n- Mach IPC for tweak injection\n- Sandbox extension management\n\n> Requires palera1n 2.x jailbreak. Does **not** require roothide."
        },
